# ✅ TASK 4 — RABBITMQ CONSUMERS

Consume directly from RabbitMQ:

* post.comment.created
* post.reply.created
* notification.created

---

## Behavior

### CommentCreatedEvent

→ Push "ReceiveComment" → group post_{postId}

### ReplyCreatedEvent

→ Push "ReceiveReply" → group post_{postId}

### NotificationCreatedEvent

→ Push "ReceiveNotification" → group user_{userId}

---

# ✅ TASK 5 — IDEMPOTENCY (MANDATORY)

## Use Redis

Key:

```
event:{eventId}
```

TTL:

```
5–10 minutes
```

Logic:

* If key exists → skip push
* If not → process + set key

